Dominating the playground with his gang Fobba-licious, amusing himself with endless filfthy jokes and a schoolyard rivalry with the Rangas, Jonah challenges the school system, getting himself into more trouble than ever before.', NULL, NULL, 1.3186, 6.278, 0, 1.03, '2026-08-10 02:34:01', '2026-08-10 02:34:01');
